<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Our story — Cox Booking</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Hind+Siliguri:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Serif+Bengali:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="bengali-ui.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="pages.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="responsive.css"></head><body><?php include 'partials.php';?><main><section class="page-hero"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500375592092-40eb2168fd21?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=85" alt="The Bay of Bengal coast"><div class="page-hero-overlay"></div><div class="page-hero-content"><div class="eyebrow light"><span></span> Our story</div><h1>A little more<br><em>like home.</em></h1><p>We believe the best trips feel less like checking in<br>and more like finding your place.</p></div></section><section class="story-intro wrap"><div class="eyebrow"><span></span> About Cox Booking</div><div class="story-grid"><h2>Rooted here.<br>Made for <em>you.</em></h2><div><p>Cox Booking began with a simple thought: finding a lovely place to stay should feel as good as the trip itself.</p><p>We’re a local team with a soft spot for this long, sunlit coast. We know its seasons, its little corners, and the people who make a visit memorable. We bring those people together with guests looking for a more thoughtful way to stay.</p></div></div></section><section class="story-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1473116763249-2faaef81ccda?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=85" alt="Open beach and sea under evening light"><div>Somewhere between the first light and the last wave.</div></section><section class="values wrap"><div class="eyebrow"><span></span> The way we see it</div><div class="value-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Thoughtfully chosen</h3><p>Every stay has a story and a host who cares. We choose places for the little things that make a difference.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Locally connected</h3><p>We live and work here. Our recommendations come from knowing the people and places along the coast.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Here for your plans</h3><p>Tell us what you’re looking for. We’ll help you find a good fit and follow up personally within six hours.</p></article></div></section><section class="page-bottom-cta"><h2>Ready to find your<br><em>place by the sea?</em></h2><a class="button button-cream" href="request.php">Tell us about your trip <span>↗</span></a></section></main><?php include 'footer.php';?></body></html>
